L339: ##### PVS
L340: We evaluate SAM 3 on a range of visual prompting tasks, including Video Object Segmentation (VOS) and interactive image segmentation. cite190†Table 6 compares SAM 3 to recent state-of-the-art methods on the VOS task. SAM 3 achieves significant improvements over SAM 2 on most benchmarks, particularly on the challenging MOSEv2 dataset, where SAM 3 outperforms prior work by 6.5 points. For the interactive image segmentation task, we evaluate SAM 3 on the 37 datasets benchmark introduced in cite157†Ravi et al.
