L567: ### A.6 Video Training Data Ablations
L568: We analyze how much the SAM 3 model benefits from the videos and annotations in SA-Co/VIDEO obtained through the video data engine, which are used in Stage 4 (video-level) training (described further in §cite75†C.4.1 ). Specifically, we train the model with a varying amount of masklets from SA-Co/VIDEO as VOS training data, and evaluate the resulting checkpoints on SA-Co/VEval under the VOS task with the $\mathcal{J}\&\mathcal{F}$ metric.
L569: The results are shown in cite245†Table 16 , where adding masklets collected with noun phrases through the video data engine (as additional Stage 4 training data) improves the $\mathcal{J}\&\mathcal{F}$ performance on both SA-Co/VEval and public benchmarks such as DAVIS17 (cite246†Pont-Tuset et al., 2017a ) and SA-V (cite157†Ravi et al., 2024 ).
